WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.131
It's eleven forty-two at night.

2
00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:05.712
Someone just saw your Instagram ad,

3
00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:08.029
and sent you a WhatsApp message.

4
00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:11.462
If your team replies at ten the next morning,

5
00:00:11.632 --> 00:00:15.017
that buyer may already be talking to someone else.

6
00:00:15.517 --> 00:00:17.458
Now imagine this instead.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.320
Your WhatsApp assistant replies in under a minute,

8
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.225
in your business's voice,

9
00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:25.942
and starts asking the right questions.

10
00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:31.625
Own home, or investment? What budget? Which area?

11
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.360
When are they moving?

12
00:00:33.936 --> 00:00:37.192
Every answer lands in a Google Sheet that you own.

13
00:00:37.692 --> 00:00:40.703
Then it offers real slots from your calendar,

14
00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.492
books the site visit,

15
00:00:42.662 --> 00:00:45.260
and sends a reminder the evening before.

16
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.500
Anything complex goes straight to your team,

17
00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.135
with a short summary.

18
00:00:50.505 --> 00:00:51.905
Ask for a person,

19
00:00:52.075 --> 00:00:54.931
or ask a medical question at a clinic,

20
00:00:55.101 --> 00:00:57.454
and it hands over instead of guessing.

21
00:00:57.954 --> 00:01:00.334
It runs on tools you can see and own.

22
00:01:01.404 --> 00:01:02.617
Make dot com,

23
00:01:02.617 --> 00:01:06.318
Claude or Open A I, WhatsApp, Google Sheets,

24
00:01:06.318 --> 00:01:08.552
Cal dot com, and Telegram.

25
00:01:08.922 --> 00:01:10.113
And every month,

26
00:01:10.147 --> 00:01:14.134
a simple report: enquiries, bookings, show-ups.

27
00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:17.645
It's designed for Bangalore real estate teams,

28
00:01:17.815 --> 00:01:21.365
interior and modular kitchen firms, and skin,

29
00:01:21.535 --> 00:01:23.592
hair and aesthetic clinics.

30
00:01:24.092 --> 00:01:26.265
Start with a thirty-day pilot,

31
00:01:26.435 --> 00:01:29.034
with a success test agreed up front.

32
00:01:29.404 --> 00:01:31.783
Pricing is shared on a short call.

33
00:01:33.733 --> 00:01:35.661
Book your fifteen-minute call,

34
00:01:36.103 --> 00:01:38.289
using the button on this page.
